Hello HN.
I&#x27;m a developer from Spain, working for a US company and building apps as side projects.<p>I discovered that Cloudflare offers so many free services, S3-compatible storage - R2 (10 GB on free tier) - among them.
So I decided to develop a small iOS sharing app, for easy sharing of files or photos, with optional custom domain links.<p>It&#x27;s half-price ($3.99) until Nov 18, also I would like to offer 20 promo codes. Write me an email to support@f-y.name with subject &quot;CloudShare promo code&quot;
